  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_83bc5c6ca1064cd8a19d81d6adacb35b",
      "statement": "IronClaw uses a three-layer configuration model: Catalog (providers.json), Selection (config.toml), and Runtime (composition-resolved). Field precedence is compiled defaults < config.toml < environment variables < CLI flags.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/app/ironclaw_config/src/config_file.rs#L1-L34",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1c20d3d73ec462204e07a167386ee3b05e988dd7cd3a6d57aa25174133ceef65:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker/reborn/config.toml",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:93f57c7efb65f21d748763fc536f43939ae751052fa6488505e5636798d08d27"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b4bedf5569694c5ebd3f1da2c02768a2",
      "statement": "Eight runtime profiles control deployment mode, storage backend, and resource limits: local-dev, local-dev-yolo, hosted-single-tenant, hosted-single-tenant-volume, hosted-single-tenant-volume-sandboxed, hosted-single-tenant-volume-sandboxed-railway, production, and migration-dry-run. Profiles are selected via IRONCLAW_REBORN_PROFILE environment variable, defaulting to local-dev.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/app/ironclaw_composition/src/deployment.rs#L90-L120",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:52d690d3752abf93c6775763e8888b320410924663677d366ca5b031cfefa7d8:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/app/ironclaw_config/src/profile.rs#L1-L100",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a84ab4abbe722ccfaae5dea04a5aaf5f7dbf8584e5a07d4ae51616b9599e42da:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ee0e303fe52e42739f6def8a60e39e15",
      "statement": "The production Dockerfile uses a five-stage build pipeline: node_toolchain (Node 22.23.1), railway_cli (Railway CLI binary), chef/planner/deps (cargo-chef dependency caching), builder (Rust compilation with --profile dist), and runtime (minimal Debian with SSH, PostgreSQL client, SQLite). The binary is compiled with dist profile using CARGO_PROFILE_DIST_PANIC=abort and CARGO_PROFILE_DIST_CODEGEN_UNITS=1.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile#L1-L160",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cc8e17ed9494df2434b32713024528502c62f6c5d73d1cb5a6d123b1cc0e9ab1:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6c1549e3ce2842a99ba69d1cef56bd4f",
      "statement": "The Docker entrypoint (/docker/reborn/entrypoint.sh) runs as root at container start, resolves IRONCLAW_REBORN_HOME, creates and chowns directories to uid 1000, installs default config.toml by profile, migrates legacy [llm.default] stubs and [slack] sections, optionally starts SSH on port 2222, then drops privilege with gosu and execs ironclaw serve.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile#L154-L160",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:611eda5ff7544f3d1efd9cb70f823f12da6aea30e1407ea57aea0a5ef7acf362:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker/reborn/entrypoint.sh#L1-L150",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8d3366ae88ac2f64e53fc00424b6fe57bbeb941d9b7d408cf31f38fd3eeac45b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ed974bd18b2b431bbbc77b26a275efce",
      "statement": "SSH on port 2222 is disabled by default in the Docker image. Setting IRONCLAW_REBORN_SSH_PUBLIC_KEY enables sshd; the public key becomes the sole authorized_keys entry. Username is 'agent' (uid 1000 alias of ironclaw runtime user), with public-key-only authentication and no password fallback. SSH sessions hold full runtime identity and can read/write everything ironclaw process owns.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker/reborn/entrypoint.sh#L60-L127",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:46d9fdb40d1db5b781a21f57809ccf6ae8c3a57e282d786a9c2fd59e572bbde0:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/internal/reborn/deploy-reborn-cli-docker.md#L220-L244",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:71887d627feb4a614b4b44dda840f483e7a73749434eb413d949bccf9f11426a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_146bbcc49016457f9fe5e96e8676b43f",
      "statement": "config.toml contains sections for boot (profile), identity (tenant/owner/agent), policy, drivers, runner (concurrency limits), skills, storage (backend selection), llm (provider per slot), webui (HTTP settings), google (OAuth IDs), budget (USD limits), trigger_poller, and memory (profile bindings). All secret values must be environment-only; inline secrets are rejected at parse time.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/app/ironclaw_config/src/config_file.rs#L54-L120",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b43611b2918d08650c60a5fc0f536e3d81650b8ea3f00e1210c38c1cc60ecc4b:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker/reborn/config.toml",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:93f57c7efb65f21d748763fc536f43939ae751052fa6488505e5636798d08d27"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ae8a8823324e4cf2a93759291868e143",
      "statement": "IronClaw boot uses environment variables: IRONCLAW_REBORN_HOME (state root), IRONCLAW_REBORN_PROFILE (deployment profile), IRONCLAW_REBORN_WORKSPACE_ROOT (project root). These override compiled defaults and control where config.toml and libSQL data are stored.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/app/ironclaw_config/src/home.rs#L1-L100",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:34b80bb748d6572a67aeaefaa208dfaff65968f9a9d0bcd81a57b88c704d9a2e:"
        },
        {
