          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9d0701491646be7924f565af8e5b6f7cd961207b3c40a3e45f0b9bb66e0aa521:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1eb85c62b7da4a1b960ba6efd7374efb",
      "statement": "LLM configuration uses named slots (default, mission) with per-slot selection: provider_id, model, api_key_env. The catalog (providers.json) lists all available providers. If no [llm.default] is configured, env-var fallback (NEARAI_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY, etc.) drives runtime resolution. No implicit slot is shipped in bundled configs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/app/ironclaw_config/src/config_file.rs#L78-L84",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5ff5189eb023bc46ac6c0ba238c557d3829deab15e84505c8b73b9f4b4c4db56:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker/reborn/config.toml#L30-L34",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b2ce777c8175b1de396aa271b1e4409f26ebec481c40b3bf9035a12213a68633:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker/reborn/entrypoint.sh#L182-L244",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6c5512c7c9fdfcc2789de2d717f34d3be848862dffa2730c4fa5f548dc2a6e3e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e8fb95cf9ef243479ffb7dc42d1e3cb9",
      "statement": "Budget configuration has three layers: compiled defaults (5 USD/day/user, 2 USD/day/project, etc.), [budget] section in config.toml, and environment variables (IRONCLAW_BUDGET_* family). Setting any USD field to 0 disables that limit. The composition root promotes string/f64 values into typed BudgetPeriod/BudgetThresholds.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/app/ironclaw_config/src/budget.rs#L1-L80",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f77def70f9023d7cb9771956fae7310d6227a8ba35d328a2b10e7847f7dbbc5f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ad82c608c81447aa9bb977eaa16f0edc",
      "statement": "Secrets are environment-only by policy. Raw secret-shaped values (hex strings ≥32 chars, base64, known patterns) pasted into config.toml are rejected at parse time by reject_inline_secret. The [google] section contains public client IDs only; client secrets must be environment variables.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/app/ironclaw_config/src/config_file.rs#L19-L34",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3c2e60d55ff270790ba7207edc026fa1d137f82d479e0c057264ed0351006c6f:"
        },
        {
